矣。」趙王以爲老，遂不召。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名、國別君序與代將敘事暫接；李牧牧在明示北邊主題內同指，趙王遷王稱限定末次代將。北邊早年趙王、他人及單于未名分存，不強接悼襄；太史公讓頗承接廉藺敘事，其他引語指代待逐處覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p020","text":"廉頗居梁久之，魏不能信用。趙以數困於秦兵，趙王思復得廉頗，廉頗亦思復用於趙。趙王使使者視廉頗尚可用否。廉頗之仇郭開多與使者金，令毀之。趙使者既見廉頗，廉頗爲之一飯斗米，肉十斤，被甲上馬，以示尚可用。趙使還報王曰：「廉將軍雖老，尚善飯，然與臣坐，頃之三遺矢矣。」趙王以爲老，遂不召。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"d9b_5t4_9eb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"6o2_xmb_367","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_3f9_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"郭開","kind":"person","person_id":"a2x_dkn_fj9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"6o2_xmb_367","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m020-0067","start":67,"end":